Depends: ${python3:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, python3-gi, python3-gi-cairo, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, gir1.2-adw-1, python3-pandas, python3-numpy, python3-httpx, python3-pyarrow
Description: AI-Powered Movie Recommendation & Discovery Platform (GTK4/Libadwaita)
 RecLens is a modern Linux movie recommendation application built with GTK4
 and Libadwaita. Powered by an ultra-portable Top-K sparse similarity model and
 snappy Parquet catalog, it delivers instant recommendations without requiring
 background daemons.
